        "gg6Qaean6e9_text": "<p>4.8/5 from 12,847 verified reviews</p>",
        "ggKZc7_goij_text": "<strong>Real Results From </strong><i><strong>Real Women</strong></i>",
        "gg3Q-EJAmbA_text": "<p><strong>My Husband Noticed Before I Did</strong></p>",
        "ggHFmL5ZWt-_text": "<p>I was skeptical — another supplement promising miracles. But within 6 weeks, the dryness improved and intimacy stopped feeling like something I had to survive. By month 3, I actually wanted to be close to him again. My husband didn’t say anything. He just started reaching for my hand.</p>",
        "ggWJsXZSiV9_text": "<p><strong>— Sarah M., 52, Austin TX &nbsp;• 4 months using ✓&nbsp;</strong></p>",
        "ggMa0sSqlaB_text": "<p><strong>Two Weeks In and I Wasn't Looking Back</strong></p>",
        "ggX7yoRbm2P_text": "<p>The joint pain was the worst part of menopause for me. I tried everything — turmeric, glucosamine, prescription anti-inflammatories. This is the first thing that actually made a difference I could feel. The sleep came back too — I stopped waking at 3 AM drenched in sweat.</p>",
        "ggPRl-q92Dv_text": "<p><strong>— Jennie T., 36, Portland OR &nbsp;• 4 months using ✓</strong></p>",
        "ggNDby2WAAP_text": "<p><strong>Stopped Dreading Mornings</strong></p>",
        "ggg_U8b3Lel_text": "<p>For two years, I woke up drenched in sweat, exhausted before my feet hit the floor. By week 5 on ShilaSource, I woke up dry. By week 8, I woke up early — on purpose. I haven’t set an alarm in months. Even the weird tingling in my hands and the heart palpitations have calmed down.</p>",
        "gg-GcmR4X_k_text": "<p><strong>— Karen W.</strong>, Age 28 • 4 months using<strong> ✓</strong></p>",
        "gg7WmRxEFOJ_text": "<p><strong>My Brain Came Back</strong></p>",
        "gg4AUwGDLoQ_text": "<p>I thought the brain fog was just aging. Forgetting words mid-sentence, losing my keys three times a day, zoning out in meetings. My doctor said it was hormonal. ShilaSource didn’t just clear the fog — it gave me my sharpness back. My team at work noticed before I did. The hair shedding slowed down and my skin cleared up too.</p>",
        "ggYcWhI1AOX_text": "<p><strong>— Michelle R.</strong>, Age 42 • 3 months using<strong> ✓</strong></p>",
        "ggsn2Pvtab9_text": "<p><strong>I Cancelled Three Other Supplements</strong></p>",
        "ggBG7qallq3_text": "<p>I was spending $140/month on biotin, iron, collagen, and a hair growth serum that stained my pillowcase. My shower drain was still full every morning. One jar of ShilaSource replaced the entire stack. By week 8, I stopped counting hairs on my pillow. By month 3, my hairdresser asked what I changed. Simpler, cheaper, and my hair is actually staying on my head.</p>",
        "ggRByv9lRXO_text": "<p><strong>— Patricia H.</strong>, Age 43 • 6 months using<strong> ✓</strong></p>",
        "ggzzPVRvJln_text": "<p><strong>My Husband Thinks I'm Lying</strong></p>",
        "ggBsisfrCnJ_text": "<p>He asked me what changed. I told him it was a jar of black resin from the Himalayas. He laughed. But the belly bloat I'd been carrying for two years started going down by week 6. I zipped up jeans I hadn't worn since before perimenopause. He stopped laughing when I walked out in them.</p>",
        "ggwsIhEX9oG_text": "<p><strong>—</strong> <strong>Donna C.</strong>, Age 49 • 5 months using <strong>✓</strong></p>",
        "ggMxfUFx6oa_text": "<p><strong>I Wore a Sleeveless Dress Again</strong></p>",
        "gggwpt215jT_text": "<p>Menopause destroyed my skin — dry, dull, crepe-y arms. I'd given up on sleeveless anything. After 10 weeks on ShilaSource, my daughter grabbed my arm and said \"Mom, your skin feels different.\" The fine lines on my neck softened. My face stopped looking tired even when I wasn't. That Sunday I wore a sleeveless dress to brunch. First time in four years.</p>",
        "ggmtv9AJPoh_text": "<p><strong>— Angela M.</strong>, Age 55 • 4 months using<strong> ✓</strong></p>",
        "ggcxKocrj4G_text": "<p><strong>The Scale Finally Moved</strong></p>",
        "ggEmKSAVjJN_text": "<p>I was eating clean, walking 10,000 steps, doing everything right — and gaining weight anyway. My endocrinologist said my metabolism had slowed with menopause. Two months on ShilaSource and the stubborn 9 lbs I'd been fighting for a year finally started coming off</p>",
        "ggpyLZ-ArMi_text": "<p><strong>— Theresa B.</strong>, Age 50 • 3 months using<strong> ✓</strong></p>",
        "gg73I4tJnBl_label": "<p>TRY SHILASOURCE TODAY!</p>",
        "ggtN0j9wmPK_childItem_0": "<p>FREE Shipping For Orders Above $70</p>",
