        "ggCylxrsAup_text": "<strong>Joint Health &amp; Inflammation</strong>",
        "ggFUxyHIVQx_text": "<p>Humic acid and fulvic acid act as potent natural anti-inflammatories, easing joint stiffness, reducing chronic discomfort, and supporting bone density as estrogen levels decline.</p>",
        "gglfZ9DwsQs_text": "<strong>Weight, Skin &amp; Hair Support</strong>",
        "gg0k_hhD38i_text": "<p>Selenium and magnesium help maintain a healthy metabolism and thyroid function, while zinc and iron support hair growth and skin clarity — combating the stubborn weight gain, thinning hair, and hormonal acne women face after 40.</p>",
